{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":22,"lang":"pl","title":"Jego, mój, siebie, ten","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Czego się nauczysz","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Ta lekcja jest o krótkich słowach zamiast imion i rzeczy: «mogę mu doradzić», «czy mogę to odkręcić?», «to etui jest moje», «przedstaw się», «chcę ten z kapturem», «potrzebuję innej metody płatności»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"Mogę mu doradzić.","hi":"him"},{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"To etui na telefon jest moje.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"Możesz się przedstawić.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"Chcę ten z kapturem.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"Potrzebuję innej metody płatności.","hi":"another"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"him, her, them — po czynności","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Jeśli osoba stoi po czynności — «doradzić mu», «wesprzeć ją» — he, she, they zmieniają się na him, her, them: I can advise him. Me i you też bywają po czynności: I do not want to disappoint you."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"czynność","accent":false},{"text":"me / you / him / her / us / them","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"Mogę mu doradzić.","hi":"him"},{"en":"I want to congratulate her.","translation":"Chcę jej pogratulować.","hi":"her"},{"en":"I admire them.","translation":"Podziwiam ich.","hi":"them"},{"en":"I do not want to disappoint you.","translation":"Nie chcę cię zawieść.","hi":"you"},{"en":"This story can amuse them.","translation":"Ta historia może ich rozbawić.","hi":"them"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can advise he.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"I can advise his.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"I want to congratulate she.","right":"I want to congratulate her."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I want to support","after":".","options":["her","she","hers"],"answer":"her","why":"Po czynności «ją / jej» — her."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"it i them — o rzeczach","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"O rzeczy po czynności mówi się it, o kilku — them: Could I unscrew it? Could I untangle them? Nie its i nie they — to inne słowa."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"czynność","accent":false},{"text":"it (jedna rzecz) / them (kilka)","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I unscrew it?","translation":"Czy mogę to odkręcić?","hi":"it"},{"en":"Could I untangle them?","translation":"Czy mogę je rozplątać?","hi":"them"},{"en":"Could I strain it?","translation":"Czy mogę to przecedzić?","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can calculate it.","translation":"Mogę to obliczyć.","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can round it down.","translation":"Mogę to zaokrąglić w dół.","hi":"it"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Could I untangle they?","right":"Could I untangle them?"},{"wrong":"Could I unscrew its?","right":"Could I unscrew it?"}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"mine, yours, ours — «mój» bez rzeczy","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Gdy rzecz jest już nazwana i mówisz «to moje», potrzebne jest osobne słowo: mine, yours, his, hers, ours. This phone case is mine. My nie stoi bez rzeczy po nim."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"to","accent":true},{"text":"is","accent":true},{"text":"mine / yours / his / hers / ours","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"To etui na telefon jest moje.","hi":"mine"},{"en":"This travel mug is yours.","translation":"Ten kubek podróżny jest twój.","hi":"yours"},{"en":"This rain jacket is ours.","translation":"Ta kurtka przeciwdeszczowa jest nasza.","hi":"ours"},{"en":"This yoga mat is hers.","translation":"Ta mata do jogi jest jej.","hi":"hers"},{"en":"This electric razor is his.","translation":"Ta golarka jest jego.","hi":"his"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"This phone case is me.","right":"This phone case is mine."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Pokazujesz matę koleżanki. Jak powiesz, że jest jej?","optionA":"This yoga mat is her.","optionB":"This yoga mat is hers.","correct":"B","explain":"«Jej» bez rzeczy po nim — hers."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"yourself — «się, siebie»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Jeśli czynność dotyczy samej osoby — «przedstaw się», «dbaj o siebie» — potrzebne jest yourself: You can introduce yourself. Samo you tu nie pasuje."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"you","accent":true},{"text":"czynność","accent":false},{"text":"yourself","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"Możesz się przedstawić.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You need to look after yourself.","translation":"Musisz o siebie dbać.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You should not blame yourself.","translation":"Nie obwiniaj się.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can be yourself.","translation":"Możesz być sobą.","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can forgive yourself.","translation":"Możesz sobie wybaczyć.","hi":"yourself"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"You need to look after you.","right":"You need to look after yourself."}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"one i ones — żeby nie powtarzać rzeczy","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Żeby nie nazywać rzeczy drugi raz, mówi się the + cecha + one (jedna) albo ones (kilka): I want the hooded one — «chcę ten z kapturem». It tu nie pasuje."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"the","accent":true},{"text":"cecha","accent":true},{"text":"one (jedna) / ones (kilka)","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"Chcę ten z kapturem.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I like the patterned ones.","translation":"Podobają mi się te we wzory.","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I prefer the padded one.","translation":"Wolę ten ocieplany.","hi":"one"},{"en":"I want the slip-on ones.","translation":"Chcę te wsuwane.","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I want the ready-to-eat one.","translation":"Chcę ten gotowy do jedzenia.","hi":"one"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I want the hooded it.","right":"I want the hooded one."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Powiedz: «Podobają mi się te we wzory».","answer":["I","like","the","patterned","ones"],"distractors":["one","it"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"another — «jeszcze jeden, inny»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Jeśli potrzebujesz jednej nowej opcji zamiast tej — another + jedna rzecz: I need another payment method — «potrzebuję innej metody płatności». Other z jedną rzeczą bez the lub a nie stoi."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"another","accent":true},{"text":"jedna rzecz","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"Potrzebuję innej metody płatności.","hi":"another"},{"en":"I need another meeting place.","translation":"Potrzebuję innego miejsca spotkania.","hi":"another"},{"en":"We use another departure gate.","translation":"Idziemy do innej bramki.","hi":"another"},{"en":"I want another room type.","translation":"Chcę inny rodzaj pokoju.","hi":"another"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."},{"wrong":"I need others payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"Powtórka: Could I…? i to — «żeby»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Z poprzednich lekcji: Could I…? — uprzejmie poprosić, to + czynność — «żeby». Could I book a table? I use an umbrella to stay dry."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I book a table?","translation":"Czy mogę zarezerwować stolik?","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"Could I get some fresh air?","translation":"Czy mogę zaczerpnąć świeżego powietrza?","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"I use an umbrella to stay dry.","translation":"Biorę parasol, żeby nie zmoknąć.","hi":"to stay"},{"en":"I fill the kettle to boil the water.","translation":"Napełniam czajnik, żeby zagotować wodę.","hi":"to boil"}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Błędy, które robi prawie każdy","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can advise he.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"Could I untangle they?","right":"Could I untangle them?"},{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Po czynności — him, her, them, it. «Moje» bez rzeczy — mine. «Się / siebie» — yourself. Nie powtarzaj rzeczy — one albo ones. Jedna nowa opcja — another."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Co zabrać do ćwiczeń","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Osoba po czynności — him / her / them. Rzecz — it / them. «Mój» bez rzeczy — mine, yours, ours. «Siebie» — yourself. Ten, który… — the … one. Inny — another."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want to praise him.","translation":"Chcę go pochwalić.","hi":"him"},{"en":"This overnight bag is yours.","translation":"Ta torba podróżna jest twoja.","hi":"yours"},{"en":"You can think for yourself.","translation":"Możesz myśleć samodzielnie.","hi":"yourself"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"02","4":"02","5":"03","6":"03","7":"03","8":"03","9":"04","10":"04","11":"04","12":"04","13":"08","14":"08","15":"08","16":"08","17":"05","18":"05","19":"05","20":"05","21":"08","22":"08","23":"08","24":"08","25":"06","26":"06","27":"06","28":"06","29":"06","30":"08","31":"08","32":"08","33":"07","34":"07","35":"07","36":"07","37":"07","38":"08","39":"08","40":"08","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08"}}
